| Concept      | What it does                   |
| ------------ | ------------------------------ |
| `import csv` | Gives Python CSV functionality |
| `open()`     | Opens a file                   |
| `with`       | Safely manages the file        |
| `DictReader` | Reads CSV rows as dictionaries |
| `for`        | Loops through students         |
| `int()`      | Converts text to an integer    |
| `append()`   | Adds an item to a list         |
| `len()`      | Counts items                   |
| `sum()`      | Adds numbers                   |
| `max()`      | Finds largest number           |
| `min()`      | Finds smallest number          |
| `if/else`    | Makes a decision               |


